{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "e0bcd06f865b4618866131dff8e00576", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "写一段向客户解释延期的话术", "id": "608d26c3fa39432db76c61efd24ada81", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:10:18.726493", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "d66658d1a5a0463db3e310b2f7fd83ad", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:10:18.726493"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "根据问题类型判断无需外部工具，直接基于已知信息作答。", "id": "82097081cdac43a3b7df63bb00e4c9ce", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:10:43.222862", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "参考话术：您好，非常抱歉，您订单 SO 编号的交付需要延长 X 天。原因是我们对关键电气件的到货时间预估偏保守，目前已锁定替代供应并调整排产，新预计交付日期为 XX。为减少影响，我们可安排工程师到厂预装调试/延长质保 1 个月。进展我会每日同步给您。", "id": "4fbd3555cf6341c288e4ab253bbbe0de", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:10:43.222862", "finished_at": "2026-06-18T09:10:43.222862"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "afb20131449e4fd2891fd8d2e6268e06", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:10:43.222862", "finished_at": "2026-06-18T09:10:43.222862"}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "给团队写一封关于交付准时率的通知", "id": "7cdde652aa7445bba7e2b20ae064de7a", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:13:05.881755", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "72ce7365ed5346d0814fa2cdade642ca", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:13:05.881755"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "这是一个业务咨询问题，结合上下文直接给出结构化回答。", "id": "5042f42320374be6b6e01dbf523b6992", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:13:24.684320", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "各位同事：近期交付准时率有所波动，请各跟单重点关注：1）预测完工与承诺交期偏差>3天的订单须提前预警；2）高风险订单每日站会过一遍；3）发货前 3 天主动同步客户物流信息。本月目标：准时率恢复 95% 以上。", "id": "571e433539f74b9db9c1c1d7033ddca3", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:13:24.684320", "finished_at": "2026-06-18T09:13:24.684320"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "8a1500fe00a142c8bb2b75762c68f29b", "created_at": "2026-06-18T09:13:24.684320", "finished_at": "2026-06-18T09:13:24.684320"}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_co